      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعِجٌ</span></b>  [and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْعَجُ</span></b> ] <i>Of a pure white colour:</i>
(L:) [pl. of the latter <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُعْجٌ</span>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِسَآءٌ نُعْجُ</span>
